07:00</published><id>https://www.courtlistener.com/docket/62592046/crowder-v-linkedin-corporation/?order_by=desc#minute-entry-476918916</id><summary type="html">Order on Administrative Motion to Consider Whether Another Partys Material Should Be Sealed AND Order on Discovery Letter Brief</summary><updated>2026-09-03T00:00:00-07:00</updated></entry><entry><title>Entry #275 in Crowder v. LinkedIn Corporation, 4:22-cv-00237</title><link href="https://www.courtlistener.com/docket/62592046/crowder-v-linkedin-corporation/?order_by=desc#entry-275" rel="alternate" /><published>2026-09-03T00:00:00-07:00</published><id>https://www.courtlistener.com/docket/62592046/crowder-v-linkedin-corporation/?order_by=desc#entry-275</id><summary type="html">Remove Incorrectly Filed Document</summary><link href="https://ecf.cand.uscourts.gov/doc1/035027602521?caseid=390494" length="0" rel="enclosure" /><updated>2026-09-03T00:00:00-07:00</updated></entry><entry><title>Entry #274 in Crowder v. LinkedIn Corporation, 4:22-cv-00237</title><link href="https://www.courtlistener.com/docket/62592046/crowder-v-linkedin-corporation/?order_by=desc#entry-274" rel="alternate" /><published>2026-09-03T00:00:00-07:00</published><id>https://www.courtlistener.com/docket/62592046/crowder-v-linkedin-corporation/?order_by=desc#entry-274</id><summary type="html"> DISCOVERY ORDER addressing  268  Discovery Letter Brief.The attached order addresses the parties' discovery letter brief. It orders as follows:1. Topic 5. LinkedIn must designate and prepare one or more witnesses to testify, to the exte nt the information is known or reasonably available to it, to Topic 5 as written, subparts (a) through (d), including LinkedIns current and historical Azure workloads and systems; its purchases of Azure services and of GPU and other AI computing capa city from Microsoft, including prices and terms; its Azure spending, commitments, and forecasts; and its plans for future use of Azure.2. Topics 6 and 7. The designees must be prepared to testify to Topics 6 and 7 for the period from January 1, 20 14, to the present.3. Topic 7(c). LinkedIn must prepare its designee to testify about the topic subpart.4. Preparation. The designees must testify to information known or reasonably available to LinkedIn on the topics as scoped by this order; t hey may reasonably rely on and explain LinkedIn's produced documents and data and need not memorize granular data.5. Timing. The court understands that the depositions will take place on September 8, 2026.The attached order contains minimal redactions. The court will separately file an unredacted order under seal and will email an unredacted courtesy copy to the parties.Signed by Judge Laurel Beeler on 9/3/2026.(lblc2, COURT STAFF) (Filed on 9/3/2026)</summary><link href="https://storage.courtlistener.com/recap/gov.uscourts.cand.390494/gov.uscourts.cand.390494.274.0.pdf" length="0" rel="enclosure" /><updated>2026-09-03T00:00:00-07:00</updated></entry><entry><title>Entry #272 in Crowder v. LinkedIn Corporation, 4:22-cv-00237</title><link href="https://www.courtlistener.com/docket/62592046/crowder-v-linkedin-corporation/?order_by=desc#entry-272" rel="alternate" /><published>2026-09-03T00:00:00-07:00</published><id>https://www.courtlistener.com/docket/62592046/crowder-v-linkedin-corporation/?order_by=desc#entry-272</id><summary type="html">Certificate/Proof of Service</summary><link href="https://ecf.cand.uscourts.gov/doc1/035027602270?caseid=390494" length="0" rel="enclosure" /><updated>2026-09-03T00:00:00-07:00</updated></entry><entry><title>Entry #271 in Crowder v. LinkedIn Corporation, 4:22-cv-00237</title><link href="https://www.courtlistener.com/docket/62592046/crowder-v-linkedin-corporation/?order_by=desc#entry-271" rel="alternate" /><published>2026-09-03T00:00:00-07:00</published><id>https://www.courtlistener.com/docket/62592046/crowder-v-linkedin-corporation/?order_by=desc#entry-271</id><summary type="html">Discovery Letter Brief</summary><link hr